OL,3,GNEWSANew maternity clinics in
OL,4,Ahospital's improvements
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town hospital will see three
OL,7,Fhigh-risk obstetric clinics held every
OL,8,Fweek as part of new improvements.
OL,10,FHorton General Hospital in Banbury,
OL,11,Fpart of Oxford University NHS
OL,12,FFoundation Trust (OUH), celebrated the
OL,13,Fcompleted #115,000 redevelopment
OL,14,Fproject of its maternity outpatient
OL,15,Fdepartment, which includes two
OL,16,Fbrand-new clinic rooms.
OL,18,FThe hospital had obstetric-led
OL,19,Fmaternity services until 2016 but it
OL,20,Fwas changed to a midwife-led unit in
OL,21,F2017 due in part to problems recruiting
OL,22,Fdoctors.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
